exit: 0
--- stdout
usage: riftc <command> [options] [file]

commands:
  lex <file>        print the token stream of a .rifts/.rifth file
  parse <file>      print the syntax tree of one file
  check <file>      check a module and everything it imports
  symbols <file>    print the module's merged symbol table (header + source)
  typed <file>      print the syntax tree with the type of every expression
  explain [code]    describe a diagnostic code, or list all codes

options:
  --diagnostic-format=human|short   diagnostic layout (default: human)
  --color=auto|always|never         colored diagnostics (default: auto)
  --root=DIR                        project root for imports (default: the file's directory)
  --stop-after=lex|parse|resolve|types  stop 'check' after a phase
  -h, --help                        show this help
  -V, --version                     show the compiler version

exit codes: 0 success, 1 errors in input, 2 bad command line, 3 internal error
--- stderr
